oginError }}</p><button class="mt-6 w-full rounded-xl bg-white py-3 font-bold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-fuchsia-100" type="submit">Log in to Watch-Anime</button><p class="mt-4 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">New here? Enter your email to create a local profile.</p></form></div></Transition>
